{"id":"d99a0019463cd387","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map.md","title":"ZFC Order10 Wellorder Segment Map","display":"df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map — ZFC Order10 Wellorder Segment Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map"],"display":"df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map — ZFC Order10 Wellorder Segment Map","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-well-order.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map — ZFC Order10 Wellorder Segment Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-well-order.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(W\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,W)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" href=\"?note=1d0b2b70d1c22cc7\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md\">../batch20/58-df-well-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(s,X,\\mathcal P(X))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(s,X,\\mathcal P(X))\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10WellorderSegmentMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10WellorderSegmentMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}wellorder\\text{-}segment\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10WellorderSegmentMap}_S(s,W,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nX=\\{z\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup W:\\exists w\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup W\\;(\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in W\\lor\\langle w,z\\rangle\\in W)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,W)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,X,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\forall a\\in X\\;\n\\left(s(a)=\\{x\\in X:\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in W\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}wellorder\\text{-}segment\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10WellorderSegmentMap}_S(s,W,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nX=\\{z\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup W:\\exists w\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup W\\;(\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in W\\lor\\langle w,z\\rangle\\in W)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,W)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,X,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\forall a\\in X\\;\n\\left(s(a)=\\{x\\in X:\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in W\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The defined object is now a map on the whole well-order; each value is the\nprincipal initial segment determined by its argument under the retained non-strict well-order convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-well-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-well-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in V$, $W\\subseteq X\\times X$, and $\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,W)$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-well-order.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(s,X,\\mathcal P(X))$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"W\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(s,X,\\mathcal P(X))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10WellorderSegmentMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order10\\text{-}wellorder\\text{-}segment\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder10WellorderSegmentMap}_S(s,W,X)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nX=\\{z\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup W:\\exists w\\in\\bigcup\\bigcup W\\;(\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in W\\lor\\langle w,z\\rangle\\in W)\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{WellOrder}(X,W)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,X,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\forall a\\in X\\;\n\\left(s(a)=\\{x\\in X:\\langle x,a\\rangle\\in W\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1390,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2876","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map.md|58-df-zfc-order10-wellorder-segment-map]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["1d0b2b70d1c22cc7","36d7463d215be751"]}